  "card": "This PR removes 21.ninja as a seed data source for makeseeds.py and removes stale documentation referencing sipa's seed. The 21.ninja seed file has been unmaintained since May 2026, meaning makeseeds.py would ingest stale addresses and expose static seed generation to domain hijacking risks if the host is ever compromised. Removing dormant sources protects the integrity of hardcoded DNS and IP seed lists shipped in future releases.",
